{
  "slug": "eterdis-strategy-skills",
  "name": "Eterdis Strategy Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Open strategy frameworks for AI agents — 11 skills that turn any LLM into a strategy thinking partner. Each skill is a structured SKILL.md prompt that guides the AI through a proven strategic framework (VRIO, Wardley Mapping, Playing to Win, Pre-Mortem, and more). Built on 20 years of consulting practice. Three modes per skill: Diagnostic (deep session), Review (periodic check), and Alert Triggers (early warnings). All skills share a company-context.md file for accumulated strategic intelligence. CC BY 4.0 licensed.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `culture-assessment` (Culture assessment and monitoring with three modes — Diagnostic for a deep session surfacing the gap between declared…), `environmental-radar` (Continuous environmental scanning across six PESTEL categories — Political, Economic, Social, Technological, Environmental, Legal), `first-principles-strategy` (First-principles strategy — strip away conventional assumptions and find the theoretical maximum for your business), `market-position` (Competitive positioning diagnostic — figures out where you actually stand relative to competitors and whether that position is…), `playing-to-win` (Strategy cascade based on Roger Martin and A.G), `pre-mortem` (Stress-test plans before committing by imagining they've already failed), `protoloop-setup` (Track Two / internal innovation system for running small, fast experiments outside the core business), `strategy-diagnostic` (The Eterdis Strategy Diagnostic — an AI-guided conversation that helps leadership teams understand their strategic situation before committing…), and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install eterdis-strategy-skills@claude-community` from `eterdis/strategy-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
